  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Animate the texture on the specified face/faces of the specified prim/prims by setting the texture scale and offset. Identical to <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSetTextureAnim" target="_blank">llSetTextureAnim</a> except able to modify any prim in the link set.</p>
</p>
